- op: discuss  # 6cea
  at: '2026-07-06T21:38:10Z'  # 6cea
  by: agent  # 6cea
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6cea
  clock: 3  # 6cea
  nonce: 6cea  # 6cea
  message: "Fixed + merged to dev (fast-forward 0da5411eb1, commit cb5cb96576). The dominant defect — Symbol.language set to a FILE PATH on boundary external symbols (openzeppelin 484 of 519 axis_conformance violations) — is fixed at the create_boundary_nodes chokepoint: the language FIELD is normalized to a registered language (all_known_languages()) or None, field-only (raw value still feeds id/stable_id/display_label, so no id churn). Safe against ADR-0031 (external-symbol-synth with language=None/protocol_origin=None is explicitly pass-ed) and ADR-0032 (external_symbol exempt). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (full run on openzeppelin-contracts): axis_conformance 519->36, external_symbol-with-path-language 484->0, cross_field 3221->3221 (unchanged), id_format 1788->1788 (unchanged). Core 100% coverage (3 new tests in test_ir.py). The residual 36 (Symbol.language='asciidoc'/'gradle' file-type labels on file-anchors — a catalog-registration gap, a DIFFERENT mechanism the item flagged as '(minor)') is split to follow-up WI-kunut."  # 6cea
